CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION public.my_incoming_bells(_section text,_post uuid DEFAULT NULL) RETURNS TABLE(id uuid,source text,post_id uuid,area text,need text) LANGUAGE sql STABLE SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=public AS $$
WITH incoming AS (
SELECT i.id,'free'::text AS source,CASE WHEN i.source='post' THEN p.id ELSE NULL::uuid END AS post_id,i.area,i.category AS need FROM public.free_work_interests i LEFT JOIN public.posts p ON i.source='post' AND p.id::text=i.entry_id WHERE auth.uid() IS NOT NULL AND public.account_allowed(auth.uid()) AND (CASE WHEN i.source='post' AND p.id IS NOT NULL THEN CASE WHEN p.service_type='service' THEN CASE WHEN p.kind='seeker' THEN 'service-wanted' ELSE 'service-providers' END ELSE CASE WHEN p.kind='seeker' THEN 'work-wanted' ELSE 'work-offered' END END ELSE i.section END)=_section AND i.user_id<>auth.uid() AND public.account_allowed(i.user_id) AND (_post IS NULL OR p.id=_post) AND (p.user_id=auth.uid() OR (i.source='entry' AND EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.free_work_entries e WHERE e.id::text=i.entry_id AND e.user_id=auth.uid())) OR (i.source='provider' AND i.entry_id=auth.uid()::text) OR (i.source='interest' AND EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.free_work_interests original WHERE original.id::text=i.entry_id AND original.user_id=auth.uid())))
UNION ALL SELECT i.id,'post',p.id,i.area,i.need FROM public.post_bell_interests i JOIN public.posts p ON p.id=i.post_id WHERE p.user_id=auth.uid() AND public.account_allowed(auth.uid()) AND public.account_allowed(i.user_id) AND i.section=_section AND (_post IS NULL OR p.id=_post)
UNION ALL SELECT d.id,'vehicle',p.id,d.from_place||' → '||d.to_place,d.vehicle_type FROM public.vehicle_bell_demands d JOIN public.posts p ON p.id=d.post_id WHERE p.user_id=auth.uid() AND public.account_allowed(auth.uid()) AND public.account_allowed(d.user_id) AND d.category=_section AND (_post IS NULL OR p.id=_post)
UNION ALL SELECT d.id,'board',NULL::uuid,d.from_place||' → '||d.to_place,d.vehicle_type FROM public.vehicle_bell_demands d JOIN public.vehicle_demand_chat_pairs pair ON pair.demand_id=d.id WHERE pair.owner_id=auth.uid() AND pair.board_rang_at IS NOT NULL AND public.account_allowed(auth.uid()) AND public.account_allowed(pair.member_id) AND d.category=_section AND _post IS NULL)
SELECT b.* FROM incoming b WHERE NOT EXISTS(SELECT 1 FROM public.dashboard_dismissals d WHERE d.user_id=auth.uid() AND d.kind='bell' AND d.item_id=b.id AND d.source=b.source) $$;